10
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:36,800
♪ We'll send him cheesy movies ♪

11
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,000
♪ The worst we can find ♪

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,333
♪ La-la-la ♪

13
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:42,800
♪ He'll have to sit
and watch them all ♪

14
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,300
♪ And we'll monitor his mind ♪

15
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,633
♪ La-la-la ♪

16
00:00:46,633 --> 00:00:49,100
♪ Now keep in mind
Joel can't control ♪

17
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,533
♪ Where the movies
begin or end ♪

18
00:00:51,533 --> 00:00:52,767
♪ La-la-la ♪

19
00:00:52,767 --> 00:00:55,433
♪ Because he used
those special parts ♪

20
00:00:55,433 --> 00:00:59,067
♪ To make his robot friends ♪

21
