He's a wisecracker.

26
00:01:08,033 --> 00:01:11,033
♪ If you're wondering how
he eats and breathes ♪

27
00:01:11,033 --> 00:01:13,367
♪ And other science facts ♪

28
00:01:13,367 --> 00:01:14,800
♪ La la la ♪

29
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:17,033
♪ Then repeat to yourself
it's just a show, ♪

30
00:01:17,033 --> 00:01:20,133
♪ I should really just relax ♪

31
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:25,100
♪ For Mystery Science
Theater 3000 ♪

32
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,167
(guitar twang)

33
00:01:26,167 --> 00:01:27,833
(mechanical whirring)

34
00:01:27,833 --> 00:01:30,500
(doors closing)

35
00:01:37,367 --> 00:01:39,600
- Hi everybody, welcome
to the Satellite of Love.

36
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,700
Uh, we'll be right back.

37
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:42,900
- Don't, no, don't Joel, no.

38
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,167
We're not starting yet.

39
00:01:44,167 --> 00:01:45,233
(sneezing)

40
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:46,700
- Bless you.

41
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:48,900
- [Magic Voice] Commercial
sign in 15 seconds.

42
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,900
(sneezing)
- Oh, gross.

43
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:53,500
- Oh Crow, here,
you got a little...

44
