129
00:04:55,267 --> 00:04:57,667
- [Tom] Look, there's Yasser
Arafat in his teen days.

130
00:04:57,667 --> 00:04:59,400
- [Joel] Walk like
an Egyptian, man.

131
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,000
- [Tom] Yeah.

132
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,233
- [Crow] Hair color
by Bozo the Clown.

133
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,267
