Sonny Bono Collection.

134
00:05:06,267 --> 00:05:07,433
(Crow laughing)

135
00:05:07,433 --> 00:05:08,800
- [Crow] Hey,
here's a good space.

136
00:05:12,867 --> 00:05:15,067
