day the music died, guys.

137
00:05:15,067 --> 00:05:16,433
Kinda late with that
coat, aren't ya?

138
00:05:16,433 --> 00:05:18,367
[Joel] Where were they
when they needed it?

139
00:05:18,367 --> 00:05:19,800
When he needed the coat.

140
00:05:21,367 --> 00:05:22,600
