147
00:05:33,533 --> 00:05:34,900
But wait, there's more.

148
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:38,100
You also get this
foxy biker chick's...

149
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:39,433
Ginsu bra snappler.

150
00:05:39,433 --> 00:05:41,167
- [Tom] That thing is huge.

151
00:05:42,567 --> 00:05:44,033
