204
00:07:29,033 --> 00:07:32,133
Chili peppers, they burn my gut.

205
00:07:32,133 --> 00:07:35,400
♪ Don't mess around ♪

206
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,633
♪ Hellcats ♪

207
00:07:36,633 --> 00:07:38,100
