must be a biker, huh?

208
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:39,333
- [Tom] Nah, that's
his Christian name.

209
00:07:39,333 --> 00:07:40,167
- [Joel] Oh.

210
00:07:43,533 --> 00:07:44,400
