211
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,567
Hope he plays Take Five.

212
00:07:46,567 --> 00:07:47,800
- [Tom] Candy Cave and her

213
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,200
Romanian cousin,
Sucrose Spelunker.

214
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:54,433
(chuckling)
- [Joel] Huh?

215
00:07:54,433 --> 00:07:55,667
