a dismal film ahead.

218
00:07:59,033 --> 00:08:00,633
- [Tom] Yep, yep.

219
00:08:00,633 --> 00:08:01,867
- [Crow] You know,
it kinda looks like

220
00:08:01,867 --> 00:08:03,633
