completely different.

235
00:08:24,033 --> 00:08:25,000
- [Crow] I'll bet, I'll bet.

236
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,233
- [Joel] No way, femmebot.

237
00:08:26,233 --> 00:08:27,733
- [Crow] Oh yes
way, space swish.

238
00:08:27,733 --> 00:08:28,700
- [Joel] Hey, I'm gonna
shut you down, Buckwheat.

239
00:08:28,700 --> 00:08:29,933
