244
00:08:35,367 --> 00:08:36,567
- [Joel] No it doesn't!
- [Crow] Yes it does.

245
00:08:36,567 --> 00:08:37,733
- [Tom] Oh...

246
00:08:37,733 --> 00:08:38,533
- [Joel] No it doesn't.
- [Crow] Does too.

247
00:08:38,533 --> 00:08:40,800
♪ Hellcats ♪

248
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,667
